# CLI Bank / ATM Simulator (C++)

Small practice program I wrote in C++ to get comfortable with `while` loops, `cin`/`cout`, and `if/else` branching for a basic menu.

## What it currently does
- Starts with a sample balance (`1289.54`)
- Lets you check balance, deposit money, withdraw money (with a basic balance check), and exit

## Known limitations / things I want to improve next
- Doesn't print a prompt before asking for deposit or withdrawal amounts
- Doesn't stop negative numbers or non-number (`cin`) inputs yet
- Balance resets when the program closes (no file saving yet)
- Fix small wording/typo stuff like `"exist"` -> `"exit"`
